    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθῳόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθῷος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to hold guiltless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθῷον ἀθῳοῦν τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Na.</u>
					1.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.Bab.
				223
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Callisth.
					1.7
				</span></i>
			:—fut.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθῳωθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Pr.</u>
					6.29
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>avenge</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινος</span>
