				<u>Je.</u>
				15.15
			</span></i>. (Written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθο-</span> before
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ω</span> in codd. of LX<i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i>)</div>
